@startuml
title H04 - Hub coverage
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "H04\nHub coverage" as H04
interface "require_node(); observe(); set_sensor_fault(); current(); reasons()" as API
database "Owned state\nrequired-node set and per-node last contact, battery and fault" as State
queue "Input / output\nHeartbeat/business contact + lease clock → Covered/Unknown/Fault and reason list" as IO
API --> H04
IO --> H04
H04 --> State : owns
component "H01\nHub ingest" as H01
H04 ..> H01 : contract / port
component "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
H04 ..> H02 : contract / port
component "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
H04 ..> H05 : contract / port
component "B08\nOperations/data" as B08
H04 ..> B08 : contract / port
note bottom of H04
Flow: Require only configured routine sources; refresh contact; report unknown for unseen/expired source; report fault separately from activity.
Guard: Current recovery never erases the historical gap. A heartbeat cannot clear an explicit sensor fault.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
